+/* Timestamp Request
+ * +-----------------------+----------------+-----------------------------------------+
+ * | Field                 | Length (bytes) | Description                             |
+ * +=======================+================+=========================================+
+ * | CMD_CODE ( 29 / 0x1D) |       1        | Message ID: The CMD_CODE is set to 29   |
